commit 177e0f4f58fdf05083cc0c1ec3d1e35f3327be38
Author: Gabe Castro <gabe@techworx.dev>
Date:   Wed Sep 9 09:21:54 2026 -0700

    refactor(vcs): dedup GitAccess read-fallback policy into one helper

    GitAccess's four READ methods (head_sha, list_tags, resolve_commit,
    commits_since) each independently reimplemented the identical
    native-gix-then-shell-fallback policy inline. Factor it into a private
